      <!-- ===== Visual-only detail for stereo SLAM (no collisions; navigable geometry unchanged) =====
           Thin textured panels on every room-facing wall surface (distinct pattern per room),
           textured floor tiles per room, and unique posters as loop-closure landmarks.
           Gazebo Sim box faces map the whole texture once, so surfaces are split into ~2 m pieces
           to keep the pattern at real-world scale (~4-5 mm per texel). -->
